{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40126,"sections":[{"id":"script-20126","name":"原始脚本 20126","scripts":[20126],"start":0,"count":24}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:0","scriptId":20126,"text":"诺伊娜带着奥莉娅和一边的路易斯合流以后，对零散的几只战车兽进行了快速得打击。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":784,"speaker":"奥莉娅·契科娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:1","scriptId":20126,"text":"“哼哼～战斗结束～怎么样～奥莉娅很厉害吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":680,"speaker":"诺伊娜·鲍尔特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:2","scriptId":20126,"text":"“恩……奥莉娅是很厉害啊，几次都绕到战车兽的死角给予正确无比的一击。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":680,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":784,"speaker":"奥莉娅·契科娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:3","scriptId":20126,"text":"“这点小事不足挂齿～啊哈哈哈哈哈～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":680,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":801,"speaker":"波比·克里斯蒂安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:4","scriptId":20126,"text":"“都有点想让你加入我们小队了呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":801,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":784,"speaker":"奥莉娅·契科娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:5","scriptId":20126,"text":"“可惜啊～我还肩负着给广大军民鼓舞士气的重大责任，不能邀约啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":801,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":801,"speaker":"波比·克里斯蒂安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:6","scriptId":20126,"text":"“哈哈～我只是随口说说，奥莉娅那么有潜力，我也不舍得就这么淹没在佣兵队伍里啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":801,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":784,"speaker":"奥莉娅·契科娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:7","scriptId":20126,"text":"“哼哼哼～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":801,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":680,"speaker":"诺伊娜·鲍尔特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:8","scriptId":20126,"text":"“不过这么频繁的战车兽，等会儿要和佐伊她们说一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":784,"right":680,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":785,"speaker":"路易斯·华盛顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:9","scriptId":20126,"text":"“是的，我也这么想，不过战车兽的频繁出现可能和软泥有一定的关系……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":785,"right":680,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":680,"speaker":"诺伊娜·鲍尔特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:10","scriptId":20126,"text":"“恩……很有可能……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":785,"right":680,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:12","scriptId":20126,"text":"这时在科研基地里——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:13","scriptId":20126,"text":"一位身着舞装的钢舞姬出现在波西娅的面前，不过就旁人看来这位钢舞姬非常特殊，因为她的舞装带有“翅膀”。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:14","scriptId":20126,"text":"“波西娅博士，引擎核心的测试已经完成了，还有没有下一步需要进行测试的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:15","scriptId":20126,"text":"“哦，是妮科尔啊，我现在有点忙，飞行测试如果完成了的话，最好去外面多飞两圈，试试移动射击之类的效果。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:16","scriptId":20126,"text":"“是的，对了，这份是之前的飞行测试报告，我放在这里了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:17","scriptId":20126,"text":"“好的，谢谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:18","scriptId":20126,"text":"波西娅其实这次来夏威夷的科研基地主要是为了对妮科尔的舞装进行测试，选择远离人际的度假胜地也是处于避人耳目的原因。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:19","scriptId":20126,"text":"“那我去旁边的小岛试试空对地射击？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:20","scriptId":20126,"text":"波西娅把视线从软泥样本处挪开，看了看外面的天气，阳光明媚。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:21","scriptId":20126,"text":"“没什么问题，那你去吧，对了这个带上，是通信装置，有什么问题第一时间联系我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:22","scriptId":20126,"text":"波西娅把通信器交给妮科尔，又重新开始研究起眼前的软泥。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:23","scriptId":20126,"text":"“好的～那我就出发了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20126:20126:24","scriptId":20126,"text":"“去吧去吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":811,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
